      "x": 0,
      "y": 330,
      "width": 820.5860000000004,
      "height": 32.5,
      "text": "The key is <definitionId>:<name>, never scoped by mount token, so two mounts of one definition read one record.\nThe g field fences a user-retained record to one session generation: a record written under another generation reads as absent.",
      "originalText": "The key is <definitionId>:<name>, never scoped by mount token, so two mounts of one definition read one record.\nThe g field fences a user-retained record to one session generation: a record written under another generation reads as absent.",
